{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aDiceyhacker 1999\u300b is a cyberpunk roguelite game that blends idle/incremental mechanics with dice-driven strategy, featuring humorous gadgets and a unique visual style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Playable in the Demo Version...\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From learning basic controls to actual dice-based battles, several stronghold combat scenarios are available. Experience the exciting elements of <i>DiceyHacker1999</i> through the DEMO!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Full Game Content Introduction\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Starting from the urban legend of the \u200b**&quot;1999 Non-Disclosure Agreement&quot;**, this game unfolds in a diverged parallel universe timeline where you play as a hacker battling corporate entities that control the world\u2014and the shadowy masterminds behind them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  <br><strong>\u3010Use your arsenal of devices to breach target networks and seize resources\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728630/extras/1idle.gif?t=1750752721\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Explore the World! \u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Amass your assets and launch assaults on dark web strongholds across the globe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728630/extras/f9c810a59449299ddef38b4c50af1fd1.avif?t=1750752721\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Mysterious Encounter! \u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Within this enigmatic dark web realm, dangers and opportunities lurk in equal measure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728630/extras/3shop.png?t=1750752721\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728630/extras/4bonus.png?t=1750752721\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Wield the Dice to Fight! \u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every die is a cipher key to rewrite code; every roll tilts the balance of the digital abyss</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728630/extras/3e96895f97cafdd958b6b620edc36d04.avif?t=1750752721\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>welcome to join our Discord</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728630?t=1750752721","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728630/e2e9cd10fff57bbad50a6d4c2d376fd3d52ac446/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750752721","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728630/aaca1ca6d976c077d79fa7563b68b052a9dc3a42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750752721","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728630/aaca1ca6d976c077d79fa7563b68b052a9dc3a42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750752721","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aDiceyhacker 1999\u300b is a cyberpunk roguelite game that blends idle/incremental mechanics with dice-driven strategy, featuring humorous gadgets and a unique visual style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Playable in the Demo Version...\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From learning basic controls to actual di